{"about_the_game":"You are an adventurer who has visited Midgard, the central city of this game's world.<br>You can complete requests or gather friends at the bar.<br>Gain experience as an adventurer by defeating monsters scattered all over the place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215030/extras/140a7426db54ae41e17a150764aff705.avif?t=1727345044\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br>\u25cfExplore various places<br>Let's explore various places from the royal capital.<br>During exploration, various events occur in addition to battles with monsters.<br>Let's improve your abilities as an adventurer while accumulating experience points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215030/extras/0104dc0347e21a3ecf386f449658c8e5.avif?t=1727345044\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br>\u25cfLabyrinth of the Abyss<br>It is an unexplored labyrinth that no one has yet ventured into.<br>It is said that gold and silver treasures never seen before are buried here.<br>Once you're confident in your skills as an adventurer, try exploring the Abyss Labyrinth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215030/extras/2376bc191e05773736fc1e8d53d55bf0.avif?t=1727345044\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br>\u25cfAbundant customizability<br>Develop your character by freely choosing from a wide variety of classes and equipment.<br>This game offers a wide range of customization options.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215030/extras/350bdece20c0a293d1167ed14ab7a4cf.avif?t=1727345044\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br><br>\u25cfBeautiful illustrations<br>There are various characters that you can make friends with.<br>Th